  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Hung (Mechanic)
    Text: "You\u2019ve been back and forth all day. Business must be good for the
      hardest-working rider in town."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Just trying to stay ahead of the bills, Uncle. You know how it is.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Hung (Mechanic)
    Text: "I do. I\u2019ve had three people asking for \"emergency\" repairs since
      morning. Everyone's in a rush, but nobody wants to check their tires!"
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "At least you\u2019re popular. I\u2019m just popular with the potholes."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Hung (Mechanic)
    Text: Haha! Well, those potholes keep us both in business. Keep grinding, buddy!
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
